******** IEEE Technically Co-Sponsored SmartTechCon2017 =E2=80=93 CALL FOR
PAPERS********



*----- Apologies for cross-postings----*


*Please forward to anyone who might be interested ***

*Greetings from SmartTechCon2017 =E2=80=A6=E2=80=A6*



I am happy to inform you that *International Conference On Smart
Technologies For Smart Nation (SmartTechCon2017)* is being conducted at
REVA University, Bengaluru, India from *17th to 19th August 2017* technical=
ly
Co-Sponsored by Bangalore IEEE & CIS.

*Keydates*

Paper Submission Deadline

1 June 2017

Notification of Acceptance

1 July 2017

Author Registration Deadline

15 July 2017

Final Paper Upload Deadline

31 July 2017

Conference

17 =E2=80=93 19 August 2017



All accepted and presented papers are eligible for submission to the IEEE
Xplore Digital Library



Details are available at: http://smarttech-conference.org/

Or for any quires contact: chair@smarttech-conference.org



Thanks.



With Regards,



General Chairs

SmartTechCon2017

